    "Quest skip to level 29: Cook's Assistant 300, Gertrude's Cat 1,525 and the Mountain Dwarf and Goblin generals parts of Recipe for Disaster 1,000 each reach 18 (the ironman guides' set); Rag and Bone Man I's 500 makes 19 and Meat and Greet's 8,000 (Children of the Sun) 29; Evil Dave's 7,000 reaches 33 and Sir Amik Varze's 4,000 (107 quest points) 35; no hourly rate, so never dealt",
