    "Poison karambwan (1-tick): 85% of the guide's 'up to 5,470' karambwan an hour (4,650), inside the karambwan money making guide's 'realistically 4,000-4,800'; Wise Old Man main's 172,800 for 1 to 30 is a band average, above the 155,700 these bands average; poison karambwan cannot be sold, so about 7 coins an XP",
    "T-bone steaks: no page rates it; the chart (92/423, a fire or range) at the same 1,220 an hour as fish (estimated); the steaks drop one a kill from Brutus (three more 10 times in 81 for members) and trade about 1,341 a day on the wiki's module but about 19,700 on the real-time series; 1-tick t-bone steaks would take 13 to 30 in under 3 minutes and are not an entry",
    "Karambwan (1-tick): 85% of the guide's 'up to 5,470' an hour; the guide's table uses 5,000 (91% of it) and the money making guide says realistically 4,000 to 4,800 of a 5,000 maximum; Wise Old Man main is about 5,200 an hour; fire and range share one chart, and cooking gauntlets do not help",
    "Karambwan (normal speed): 85% of the guide's 1,435.9 an hour at a fire beside a bank, against the money making guide's 'typically 1,200'; the guide's own column assumes 1,385 an hour in the Hosidius kitchen (its location table says 1,365) and the elite Kourend & Kebos Diary from 79, which gives up to 6% more there; karambwan lose a little below about 50 and pay above it at 20 October prices",
    "Fish (both entries): the best of tuna, lobster, bass, swordfish, monkfish, shark and anglerfish at each level by the fish pages' charts at 85% of 1,435.9 an hour on a fire beside a bank; the Hosidius kitchen (easy Kourend & Kebos Diary) is within 1% with gauntlets until 96 and up to 16% better without them (sharks at 80 and 81, anglerfish about 10%), which req cannot weigh; the guide's table assumes gauntlets, the Hosidius kitchen and the elite diary from 79; bass is not in the guide's table but is the best fish without gauntlets from 43 to 78",
    "Bake Pie spell: 85% of 1,883.7 pies an hour (27 casts of 3 ticks and 5 ticks of banking, which the guide rounds to 1,885); bands only for apple, admiral, dragonfruit and summer pies, the tiers that trade in bulk on the real-time series (180-day medians 15,702 to 73,160 a day); summer pies at 95 come within 0.05% of wine at 13 times its cost; the Magic XP (60 a cast) is not counted in Cooking",
    "Jugs of wine: 85% of the guide's 'up to 490,000' (a 494,100 rebuild with 5 ticks of banking) from 68, and below 68 times the chance of a good wine (48/352) with a 12-second pause to ferment each level, as the guide advises; the guide starts it at 35 but both ironman guides only at 68, and an ironman is rated as if supplied with grapes, which come from the Vinery, Zulrah, Vorkath and Venators (the Culinaromancer's Chest sells 10 a world); above Wise Old Man's ironman table, which counts its shop-hopping karambwan method's supplies and so is no ceiling for supplied rates",
    "Sweetcorn at Kastori: 85% of the Ironman Guide's 'up to 70,000 experience per hour at level 54', one player's figure from April 2024; no page times the picking, so below 53 it is scaled by the chart (estimated)",
