    "Servery pineapple pizzas: 85% of the Mess page's 'above 200,000' with perfect clicks, inside its 'expect 165,000-180,000'; the Ironman Guide says 150,000 to 200,000 and a rough tick count of the 13-pizza loop allows 155,000 to 196,000; XP a pizza depends on the soldiers' appreciation, hence the world hops",
